{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20067","headline":"寄张籍 · 孟郊","name":"寄张籍","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"未见天子面，不如双盲人。\n贾生对文帝，终日犹悲辛。\n夫子亦如盲，所以空泣麟。\n有时独斋心，髣髴梦称臣。\n梦中称臣言，觉後真埃尘。\n东京有眼富不如，西京无眼贫西京。\n无眼犹有耳隔墙，时闻天子车辚辚。\n辚辚车声辗冰玉，南郊坛上礼百神。\n西明寺後穷瞎张太祝，纵尔有眼谁尔珍。\n天子咫尺不得见，不如闭眼且养真。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20067.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20067","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}